OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe week begins at the Peniarth
OL,7,     FArms in Wales, with hosts Susanne
OL,8,     Fand Anwen. Toby and Kath feel like
OL,9,     Fthey've been transported in time,
OL,10,     Fwhile Ryan and Sarah kick up a
OL,11,     Ffuss about their room.
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe second destination of the week
OL,14,     Fis Apple Camping in Pembrokeshire.
OL,15,     FHost Toby's guests appreciate his
OL,16,     Funique take on glamping, but a
OL,17,     Flack of basics makes for some
OL,18,     Fnot-so-happy campers.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
