OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FPaula, who's 84, is referred to St
OL,7,     FGeorge's for urgent treatment.
OL,8,     FDerek, who's 74, has had a
OL,9,     Fsuspected stroke. Glenn, who's 31,
OL,10,     Fhas a suspected abscess in his
OL,11,     Fthroat.
OL,12,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FParamedics treat a man who's
OL,14,     Fcrashed his motorbike, a boy with
OL,15,     Fchest pains and a family history
OL,16,     Fof heart problems, a woman with
OL,17,     Fabdominal pain and a baby who has
OL,18,     Fa worrying cough.
